00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.800
In this case, it turns
out that even though we're

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.960
talking about positions
on earth most of the time,

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.668
you could actually
take the same concepts

00:03:37.668 --> 00:03:39.585
