00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:02.100
is focused on really taking care
of the CNCF Technical Community

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.260
as a CTO, so working with our
independent technical board

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.275
to make sure we're
accepting wonderful projects

00:07:07.275 --> 00:07:09.400
into the community, and
also making sure in general

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.460
our projects and developers are
super happy with the services

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.368
that the Foundation provides.

00:07:14.368 --> 00:07:16.660
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Now, that
